:: RobinTemple Promise Widgets [widget]
<<widget 'robin-temple-promise-ready'>>
  <<set _robinPromiseReady to $RobinTemple.stage is 'approved' and $robinromance is 1
    and !$RobinTemple.punish
    and $templePromised is ''>>
<</widget>>

<<widget 'robin-temple-promise-trait-name'>>
  <<if _args[0]>><<lanSwitch 'Broken Promise: ' '破碎的承诺：'>><<else>><<lanSwitch 'Rite of Promise: ' '承诺仪式：'>><</if>>
  <<if $RobinTemple.templePromised is 'Robin' and $templePromised is 'Sydney'>>
    <span class='tentacle'><<lanSwitch 'As Two, As One' '两者如一'>></span>
  <<elseif $RobinTemple.templePromised is 'Robin'>>
    <<= maplebirch.auto('Robin')>>
  <<else>>
    <<= maplebirch.auto($templePromised)>>
  <</if>>
<</widget>>

<<widget 'robin-temple-promise-blocked'>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Jordan will not authorise a second promise while your existing promise stands.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你已经立下过共同誓约，约旦不会再为你主持第二份承诺仪式。
  <</language>><br><br>
<</widget>>

:: RobinTemple Promise Rite
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<npc Robin 1>><<npc Jordan 2>><<person2>>
<<if $RobinTemple.stage is 'approved' and $RobinTemple.evaluation_day gte 0>>
  <<npcincr Robin lust 1>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <<effects>>
      <<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_day to -1>><<set $RobinTemple.stage to 'approved'>>
      Jordan leads you back into the other room, where Robin waits. <<person1>><<He>> excitedly hops up from <<his>> seat. "So? Did we...?"
      <br><br>
      "Yes. Congratulations, my children, you've passed. Your union will be permitted, with the full support of myself and every other member of the order. The bishop will be informed at once, and your rings are already being prepared." <<npcincr "Jordan" love 5>><<gglove "Jordan">>
      <br><br>
      Robin barrels into you, hugging you with enough force to nearly knock you over. You hear a few gentle sobs, and find your own eyes watering. <<trauma -24>><<llltrauma>>
      <br><br>

    <<option 'CN'>>
      <<effects>>
      <<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_day to -1>><<set $RobinTemple.stage to 'approved'>>
      约旦将你带到罗宾等候的房间。<<person1>><<He>>一见到你，便兴奋地从座位上跳了起来。"怎么样？我们……? "
      <br><br>
      “是的，我的孩子们，我在此向你们二位表示祝贺，你们通过了。在神殿所有兄弟姐妹的见证下，你们的结合将会得到主的认可。主教将会立马知晓，你们的戒指也已经在准备了。” <<npcincr "Jordan" love 5>><<gglove "Jordan">>
      <br><br>
      罗宾飞扑而来，用尽全身力气抱住你，几乎要把你推倒。你听见几声轻微的抽泣，你的眼眶也湿润了。<<trauma -24>><<llltrauma>>
      <br><br>

  <</language>>
<</if>>
<<robin-temple-promise-ready>>
<<if _robinPromiseReady>>

  <<lanLink ['Next', '继续'] 'RobinTemple Promise Altar'>><</lanLink>><br>
<<else>>
  <<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return to Robin', '回到罗宾的座位'] 'RobinTemple Corner'>><</lanLink>><br>
<</if>>

