        <<if $enemyarousal gte ($enemyarousalmax / 5) * 2>>
          Robin lets out a pained moan, and quickly covers <<his>> mouth to stifle it. <<He>> looks down in shame. "I... I think that's enough for me..."
        <<else>>
          "W-wait! Please, that..." Robin clings to you. "Th-that really hurt. I mean, I... I still kind of liked it, but..." <<His>> face flushes, and <<he>> looks away. "C...can we finish this another time?"
        <</if>>
      <<option 'CN'>>
        <<if $enemyarousal gte ($enemyarousalmax / 5) * 2>>
          罗宾漏出一丝痛苦的呻吟，然后迅速用手捂住了自己的嘴巴。<<He>>羞愧地埋下了头，“我……我到这里就好……”
        <<else>>
          “等，等一下！求你，那个……”罗宾紧紧抱着你，“那、那真的有点痛……我的意思是，我还是很喜欢的，但……”<<his>>脸红了，看向一边，“能……能不能下次再做完？”
        <</if>>
    <</language>>
    <<npcincr Robin lust 5>><<gglust 'Robin'>>
    <br><br>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        "I love you," <<he>> says. "I'm so happy." <<He>> kisses you on the cheek again, and <<he>> reluctantly separates from you. <<tearful>> you help <<him>> stand from the altar.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        “我爱你，”<<he>>说，“我好高兴。”<<He>>再次在你脸上印下一吻，然后不情愿地从你身上离开。<<tearful>>你帮<<him>>从圣坛上站了起来。
    <</language>>
  <<else>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        <<if $enemyarousal gte ($enemyarousalmax / 5) * 2>>
          "S...stop? But I..." <<he>> stammers off while still clinging on to you. "O-okay..."
        <<else>>
          Robin looks at you nervously. "Did I... did I do something wrong?"
        <</if>>
      <<option 'CN'>>
        <<if $enemyarousal gte ($enemyarousalmax / 5) * 2>>
          “不……不做了？可是我……”<<he>>仍紧紧拥着你，话说到一半就断了，“好，好吧……”
        <<else>>
          罗宾紧张地看着你。“我……我做错什么了吗？”
        <</if>>
    <</language>>
    <<npcincr Robin lust 5>><<set maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').faith += 2>><<gglust 'Robin'>><<gconviction 'Robin'>>
    <br><br>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        "I love you," <<he>> says. "I'm so happy." <<He>> kisses you on the cheek again, and <<he>> reluctantly separates from you. <<tearful>> you help <<him>> stand from the altar.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        “我爱你，”<<he>>说，“我好高兴。”<<He>>再次在你脸上印下一吻，然后不情愿地从你身上离开。<<tearful>>你帮<<him>>从圣坛上站了起来。
    <</language>>
  <</if>>
  <br><br>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You retrieve your neatly folded clothing, and Robin does the same. "It still doesn't feel real," <<he>> says quietly. "That we can just... be together." <<He>> places <<his>> head on your shoulder.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你拿回你整齐叠好的衣服，罗宾也紧随其后。“还是觉得不太真实，”<<he>>轻声说，“我们竟然可以……就这样在一起。”<<He>>把手搭在你的肩上。
  <</language>>
  <<storeon 'ritual'>><<clotheson>><<endcombat>>
